  "v401": [
    {
      "text": "DappGo existed before this hackathon.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.275223881
    },
    {
      "text": "This verifier, its site and every piece of evidence were built between October 27 and November 4.",
      "start": 2.275223881,
      "end": 8.24
    }
  ],
  "v402": [
    {
      "text": "A finance post goes viral.",
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 10.686829268
    },
    {
      "text": "Thousands repost it.",
      "start": 10.686829268,
      "end": 11.984390244
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it right?",
      "start": 11.984390244,
      "end": 12.762926829
    },
    {
      "text": "This one has a real number — and the wrong period.",
      "start": 12.762926829,
      "end": 16.006829268
    },
    {
      "text": "Numbers like this move money, and wrong numbers lose it.",
      "start": 16.006829268,
      "end": 19.64
    }
  ],
  "v403": [
    {
      "text": "And it's not just text.",
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 23.584444444
    },
    {
      "text": "Screenshots,",
      "start": 23.584444444,
      "end": 24.411111111
    },
    {
      "text": "PDFs, podcasts, videos — numbers everywhere.",
      "start": 24.411111111,
      "end": 27.442222222
    },
    {
      "text": "How do you check all of them?",
      "start": 27.442222222,
      "end": 29.44
    }
  ],
  "v404": [
    {
      "text": "Asking a model directly gets one in five right.",
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 37.809801325
    },
    {
      "text": "Give the same model SEC evidence, and let a program decide:",
      "start": 37.809801325,
      "end": 42.592317881
    },
    {
      "text": "nine in ten — on held-out claims, 240 of 266.",
      "start": 42.592317881,
      "end": 46.24
    }
  ],
  "v405": [
    {
      "text": "Here's how.",
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 50.792916667
    },
    {
      "text": "Meta's Muse Spark reads the post, extracts each claim and chooses which SEC lookup to run.",
      "start": 50.792916667,
      "end": 57.280416667
    },
    {
      "text": "Python does the arithmetic and returns the verdict.",
      "start": 57.280416667,
      "end": 60.956666667
    },
    {
      "text": "The model proposes; the program decides.",
      "start": 60.956666667,
      "end": 63.84
    }
  ],
  "v406": [
    {
      "text": "Live, on the site.",
      "start": 66.0,
      "end": 67.225714286
    },
    {
      "text": "Paste the post and run it.",
      "start": 67.225714286,
      "end": 68.996190476
    },
    {
      "text": "Contradicted, with the filing.",
      "start": 86.561183041,
      "end": 88.604040184
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the corrected draft; cost and time are on the receipt.",
      "start": 89.329392583,
      "end": 93.551297345
    },
    {
      "text": "Every SEC call is on the record.",
      "start": 95.325230958,
      "end": 97.504278577
    }
  ],
  "v407": [
    {
      "text": "The same checks run in batch from the command line — text, screenshots through Muse OCR, audio through Muse Voice Transcribe.",
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 132.606557377
    },
    {
      "text": "On saved Threads posts, the median was 6.8 seconds.",
      "start": 132.606557377,
      "end": 136.118032787
    },
    {
      "text": "At that median, a thousand posts take about two hours on one worker.",
      "start": 136.118032787,
      "end": 140.8
    }
  ],
  "v408": [
    {
      "text": "Ninety point two percent on held-out claims.",
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 151.146368715
    },
    {
      "text": "It wrongly says 'supported' once in 139.",
      "start": 151.146368715,
      "end": 154.006703911
    },
    {
      "text": "Two cents and ten seconds a claim.",
      "start": 154.006703911,
      "end": 156.437988827
    },
    {
      "text": "On real posts, coverage is reported separately from accuracy.",
      "start": 156.437988827,
      "end": 160.8
    }
  ],
  "v409": [
    {
      "text": "Every number, checked against the filing.",
      "start": 164.0,
      "end": 166.858285714
    },
    {
      "text": "hackathon dot dappgo dot com.",
      "start": 166.858285714,
      "end": 168.88
    }
  ]
